{"title":"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b Part i","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1b\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1b</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <i>magic square</i> is a grid of numbers in which the sum of the numbers in each row, in each column, and on each of the two main diagonals is equal to the same number (called the <i>magic constant</i>). \n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b_Part_i&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1b\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b\" title=\"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b\">Problem 1b</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1b\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A magic square is to be formed using the sixteen integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b_Part_i&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Calculate the sum of the sixteen integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b_Part_i&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding the numbers one by one, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9dbd8f405df2c4d5a6c52f04eed03c6aeb15a82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + \\cdots + 15 + 16 = 3 + 3 + 4 + 5 + \\cdots + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"481\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/9/549bee113d9e78319890626c0d8be223cd2a4633.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=6 + 4 + 5 + 6 + \\cdots + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"248\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddfb3b99f18a4ae8106742410a1380987e322fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=10 + 5 + 6 + 7 + \\cdots + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"257\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/4/6c40ddc14d97d4f89d36523f10878120b57a5e12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=15 + 6 + 7 + 8 + \\cdots + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"257\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b5bbdfc5e34174ab07632b45514b4902107c265.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=21 + 7 + 8 + 9 + \\cdots + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"257\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d3e81960d8b296c3cd27af0cb56da006e00a09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=28 + 8 + 9 + 10 + \\cdots + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"266\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/1/48140efbdb4aed4bc28192c59ba6ae74056fda1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=36 + 9 + 10 + 11 + \\cdots + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"276\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/4/014f3a73037e32ab168652fffb12ad1e4a6e5642.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=45 + 10 + 11 + 12 + \\cdots + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"285\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/c/46c443cc4f0a4e7bb34cdfd121ba544702414555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=55 + 11 + 12 + 13 + 14 + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"282\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/8/b087524f15bb187cd48bf16fa4802a69a4c63b69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=66 + 12 + 13 + 14 + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/6/d762eb5cb5d8d75d68ff24d124a63d44ee11dfcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=78 + 13 + 14 + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"201\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/b/01b191ade81ea1eb68e74ce006eaf5c8787bb196.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=91 + 14 + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"160\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/258af09f80cec49d569485e7f10b6eb3e70d0f96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=105 + 15 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/8/228a0e4d7bf7a33ac02df8c05ffff0c7b71f74f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=120 + 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/9/ab9ead74d12178f793fe958ac591fb88bc8e2d7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{136}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b_Part_i&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adb5fc01282fd14c900227b52b55e20966582cc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + \\cdots + (n - 1) + n = \\frac{n(n + 1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"324\" height=\"40\" /> for all natural <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/8/fa8365354ede99cace5a009960cf9f96a28ed93c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + \\cdots + 15 + 16 = \\frac{16(16 + 1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"308\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aaea54bb0ef3dc9759078847a6fa326dcbd960f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=8 \\times 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/9/ab9ead74d12178f793fe958ac591fb88bc8e2d7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{136}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017215443\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 130/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1206/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4679/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   21.867      1 -total\n 64.75%   14.159      1 2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n 34.76%    7.601      1 2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b\n 25.00%    5.467      1 Tem